## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\QUI\assets\QUI
## Notes: Configuration UI for QUI
## Author: Zol and Drew
## Version: 5.2.1-beta4
## Category: User Interface
## Group: QUI
## RequiredDeps: QUI
